    "detailed_description": "<h1>View full game page</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>&quot;Bureau of Contacts: Mansion&quot;</strong> is a limited free version of the &quot;Bureau of Contacts&quot; full game, in which you can try the game loop of a full-fledged game based on one of its locations - an old mansion haunted by a ghost. <br><br>As an agent of the Bureau, you will have to:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESEARCH</h2>Use the basic toolkit to search for clues and identify the mansion's ghost.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT DOSSIERS</h2>Interact with the ghost in voice or by chat to obtain its personal data necessary for the exorcism ritual.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXORCISE</h2>Follow the instructions in the Journal and correctly perform the exorcism procedure to fully complete your mission.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2>Observe and use the features of the ghosts to stay alive as long as possible and have time to do as much as possible for your Bureau.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GO TO THE NEXT LEVEL</h2>Think you're ready to go to the next level?<br>&quot;Bureau of Contacts&quot; - more locations, tools and ghosts, co-op mode, and generative AI built into enemies that makes the game even more realistic and unpredictable.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>&quot;Bureau of Contacts: Mansion&quot;</strong> is a limited free version of the &quot;Bureau of Contacts&quot; full game, in which you can try the game loop of a full-fledged game based on one of its locations - an old mansion haunted by a ghost. <br><br>As an agent of the Bureau, you will have to:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESEARCH</h2>Use the basic toolkit to search for clues and identify the mansion's ghost.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT DOSSIERS</h2>Interact with the ghost in voice or by chat to obtain its personal data necessary for the exorcism ritual.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXORCISE</h2>Follow the instructions in the Journal and correctly perform the exorcism procedure to fully complete your mission.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2>Observe and use the features of the ghosts to stay alive as long as possible and have time to do as much as possible for your Bureau.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GO TO THE NEXT LEVEL</h2>Think you're ready to go to the next level?<br>&quot;Bureau of Contacts&quot; - more locations, tools and ghosts, co-op mode, and generative AI built into enemies that makes the game even more realistic and unpredictable.",
    "short_description": "Explore an old mansion full of paranormal dangers alone. Find clues, identify ghosts, collect their dossiers and exorcise them.",
